  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given a plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is parallel to two lines whose direction ratios are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,</p><p>So normal of plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now equation of plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> which passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, coordinates of plane making intercepts at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math>&nbsp;axis will be&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p>Now finding&nbsp;volume of tetrahedron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>48</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
